    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C66H7NS005P"
    ],
    "text": "Semantic dependency traversal walks the graph along `affects`, `derives_from`, or `constrains` edges to map potential impact zones when a node changes.",
    "title": "00C6HQACJG00V",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C66H7NS005P",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C66H7NS005P",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Semantic dependency traversal walks the graph along `affects`, `derives_from`, or `constrains` edges to map potential impact zones when a node changes.",
    "title": "00C6HQACJG00W",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C66H7NS005Q",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C66H7NS005Q",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C66H7NS005R"
    ],
    "text": "Advisory invalidation marks affected views or nodes as “stale” or “questioned”, preparing diff proposals or triage queues for human review rather than blindly rewriting downstream documents.",
    "title": "00C6HQACJG00X",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C66H7NS005R",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C66H7NS005R",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Advisory invalidation marks affected views or nodes as “stale” or “questioned”, preparing diff proposals or triage queues for human review rather than blindly rewriting downstream documents.",
    "title": "00C6HQACJG00Y",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C66H7NS005S",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C66H7NS005S",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C66H7NS005T"
    ],
    "text": "Contradiction sweeping identifies edge conflicts before they silently pollute other views.",
    "title": "00C6HQACJG00Z",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C66H7NS005T",
