  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C66H7NS005Y",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C66H7NS005Y",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C66H7NS005Z"
    ],
    "text": "Full automation creates brittle, over-constrained systems that fight human intuition and fluid workflow context.",
    "title": "00C6HQACJG014",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C66H7NS005Z",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C66H7NS005Z",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Full automation creates brittle, over-constrained systems that fight human intuition and fluid workflow context.",
    "title": "00C6HQACJG015",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C66H7NS0060",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C66H7NS0060",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C66H7NS0061"
    ],
    "text": "Human mental graphs handle ambiguity, shifting constraints, and informal consensus seamlessly, which deterministic engines collapse.",
    "title": "00C6HQACJG016",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C66H7NS0061",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C66H7NS0061",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Human mental graphs handle ambiguity, shifting constraints, and informal consensus seamlessly, which deterministic engines collapse.",
    "title": "00C6HQACJG017",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C66H7NS0062",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C66H7NS0062",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C66H7NS0063"
    ],
    "text": "Complete automated overwriting risks context collapse by treating exploratory comments or questions as hard state updates.",
    "title": "00C6HQACJG018",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C66H7NS0063",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C66H7NS0063",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Complete automated overwriting risks context collapse by treating exploratory comments or questions as hard state updates.",
    "title": "00C6HQACJG019",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C66H7NS0064",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C66H7NS0064",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C66H7NS0065"
    ],
    "text": "The goal is explicit externalization and human-in-the-loop advisory feedback, not autonomous machine control.",
    "title": "00C6HQACJG01A",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C66H7NS0065",
