  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C66H7NS0069",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C66H7NS0069",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C66H7NS006A"
    ],
    "text": "Idempotent round-tripping requires updating only the modified delta when an agent parses human edits on rendered Markdown without clobbering unrendered graph metadata.",
    "title": "00C6HQACJG01F",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C66H7NS006A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C66H7NS006A",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Idempotent round-tripping requires updating only the modified delta when an agent parses human edits on rendered Markdown without clobbering unrendered graph metadata.",
    "title": "00C6HQACJG01G",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C66H7NS006B",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C66H7NS006B",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C66H7NS006C"
    ],
    "text": "Granularity of nodes requires balancing atomic entities to avoid noise and coarse documents to preserve deep read benefits.",
    "title": "00C6HQACJG01H",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C66H7NS006C",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C66H7NS006C",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Granularity of nodes requires balancing atomic entities to avoid noise and coarse documents to preserve deep read benefits.",
    "title": "00C6HQACJG01J",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C66H7NS006D",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C66H7NS006D",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C66H7NS006E"
    ],
    "text": "Loose coupling of agent roles keeps agents stateless and lets the graph own canonical state so any agent can crash or be swapped out seamlessly.",
    "title": "00C6HQACJG01K",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C66H7NS006E",
