    "blockId": "00C66Q271R01S",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Reconciling separate hosts' diverged `aperas_apeiron` histories (push/pull, possibly rebase) — currently only fetched-and-inspected, not merged.",
    "title": "00C6834Z7001C",
    "tombstonedAt": "2026-08-30T20:47:23.296Z",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C66Q271R01T",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C66Q271R01T",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Reconciling separate hosts' diverged `aperas_apeiron` histories (push/pull, possibly rebase) — currently only fetched-and-inspected, not merged.",
