    "text": "**Projection Engines (Phase 1)**: the Human UI (SolidJS read-projection, 'Hover Preview' link mechanism) remains undesigned — of the three modes in `Aperas-core-ontology-design.md` §5.A, mode 1 (Artifact Projection) is implemented and mode 3 (Agentic Interface) is designed (Phase 0, above); only mode 2 (Human UI) is still untouched.",
    "title": "00C6834Z70017",
