    "blockId": "00C6JCP37G01N",
    "children": [],
    "text": "**Implemented and verified**: `thematicBreak`/`html` (§4) — `astParser.ts`, `reconcile.ts`,\n`project.ts` all updated, `verify:phase0 -- --db` clean.",
    "title": "## 8. Status",
    "tombstonedAt": "2026-08-30T18:36:24.224Z",
    "type": "heading",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
